+     seek 13.3 ms, start < 60 s, stop < 15 s) gives the provisional values
+     3 / 13.3 / 26 ms, start 60 s, stop 15 s.
+   - RC25 (RC25 Disk Subsystem User Guide, EK-ORC25-UG-002, Sep 1983):
